**/.wxai/impact-pending.json
**/.wxai/impact-approvals.json
**/.wxai/impact-crossings.jsonl
**/.wxai/impact-crossings.checkpoint
**/.wxai/impact-unattended.json
# [SCOPE 137 / T019] The owner-set impactMode as last fetched from wxKanban (a cache).
**/.wxai/impact-mode.json
**/.wxai/*.tmp

# Generated report renders — reproducible from the committed .md (docs/db-analysis/README.md)
docs/db-analysis/*.pdf

# [SCOPE 118] Kit-author drivers. These live inside wxkanban-agent/ for module
# resolution (the kit is CommonJS, the repo root is ESM) but are author tooling,
# not consumer kit content. They cannot be committed as-is because they use
# console.log, which Constitution IV forbids under wxkanban-agent/. Ignoring them
# keeps them on disk, keeps the kit-sync untracked-guard quiet, and — together
# with the copyFilter exclusion in scripts/sync-to-orchestrator.mjs — ensures
# they never reach a public release.
wxkanban-agent/mkproposal.ts
wxkanban-agent/run-implement.ts

# Large binary working material — ~30 MB, none of it consumer-facing.
#
# The kit ships only wxkanban-agent/, _wxAI/, shared/ and .claude/
# (scripts/sync-to-orchestrator.mjs KIT_DIRS), so nothing here can reach a kit
# release. These are local inputs and generated renders, kept on disk and out of
# git rather than bloating every clone.
#
# Numbered marketing renders (01-04): generated output. Reproducible from source
# — marketing/feature-set.pdf stays TRACKED as the published artifact.
marketing/[0-9][0-9] *.pdf

# The design-system reference pack is deliberately NOT ignored — it is wxKanban
# source material (SCOPE-114 / SPEC-115), read by scripts/seed-design-systems.ts,
# and 100 text files at 1.8 MB. Keeping it in git is what makes a fresh clone able
# to re-seed the catalog.
#
# It must never reach a customer, and that is structural rather than a rule here:
# the kit ships only wxkanban-agent/, _wxAI/, shared/ and .claude/ (KIT_DIRS in
# scripts/sync-to-orchestrator.mjs), so nothing under marketing/ can enter a kit
# release. Do not add marketing/ to KIT_DIRS.
#
# Only the zip is ignored — a redundant copy of the tracked directory.
marketing/AIBM-Design-Systems-Pack.zip

# Third-party WinDev technical documentation used as wxConversion input. Sample
# customer material, referenced by nothing in the repo.
resources/HourGlass2025_Documentation.pdf

# [SCOPE 118] Kit-author drivers. These live inside wxkanban-agent/ for module
